OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits killing schoolboy in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving after a 12-year-old
OL,8,Fboy died in a hit-and-run crash as he
OL,9,Fmade his way home from school.
OL,11,FLatvian national Dolars Aleksanders was
OL,12,Fextradited to the UK last month,
OL,13,Ffollowing the death of Keaton Slater in
OL,14,FCoventry in 2024.
OL,16,FThe 23-year-old appeared at Warwick
OL,17,FCrown Court via a virtual link from HMP
OL,18,FDovegate on Thursday and only spoke to
OL,19,Fidentity himself and enter his guilty
OL,20,Fplea.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
